{"id":"n71362-1-7","stage":3,"title":"짙다 · 深","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71362-1-7-1","ko":"저고리 색이 너무 연해서 치마랑 안 어울린다.","zh":"这件韩服的上衣颜色太浅了，和裙子不搭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저고리","meaning":"韩式短袄","explanation":"저고리：韩式短袄。","readings":[{"term":"저고리","audio":"/audio/ed534845c1179c536f7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25000","senseId":"1","lemma":"저고리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저고리","audio":"/audio/ed534845c1179c536f7f.mp3"}},{"text":"색이","meaning":"色","explanation":"색：色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"4","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"색이","audio":"/audio/248f74bf792c52bb9759.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"연해서","meaning":"淡，浅","explanation":"연하다：淡，浅；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"연하다","audio":"/audio/d12ced81f1cc251a380e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14027","senseId":"2","lemma":"연하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연해서","audio":"/audio/f5b55f73159f34e60231.mp3"}},{"text":"치마랑","meaning":"裙，裙子","explanation":"치마：裙，裙子；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"치마","audio":"/audio/b967dea5488a0b55846e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57331","senseId":"1","lemma":"치마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치마랑","audio":"/audio/22352faf28d4b7913ea4.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surf